<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex. sa and phyogs own ground and place separately. lcang lcong owns the HGM-attested crags; the additional gullies and any individual lcang/lcong correspondences remain unpaired because their lexical scope is unresolved. mtho dma' owns highs and lows with tighter members; bgrod dka' ba owns the established travel only with difficulty recast with travel/difficulty members. phra ma remains unpaired: split alone loses its speech content, talk alone loses division, and the complete attested expansion includes supplied participants and your. The fear-causes construction remains a phrase with many separate. Supplied framing, always, participants, auxiliaries, conjunctions and distributed existence wording remain unwrapped.</div>
